      "distinction": "Unlike the Short-winged Meadow Katydid which has reduced wings and prefers wet meadows, or the Slender Meadow Katydid found in freshwater marshes, the Saltmarsh Meadow Katydid is distinguished by its exclusive salt marsh habitat and well-developed wings."
